eft: 8px;\"> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\"></div> <div style=\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg)\"></div></div><div style=\"margin-left: auto;\"> <div style=\" width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\"></div> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\"></div> <div style=\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\"></div></div></div> <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\"> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 224px;\"></div> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 144px;\"></div></div></a><p style=\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:17px; margin-bottom:0; margin-top:8px; overflow:hidden; padding:8px 0 7px; text-align:center; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap;\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Deg3AtuNNtK/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" style=\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; line-height:17px; text-decoration:none;\" target=\"_blank\">A post shared by WTA (@wta)</a></p></div></blockquote>\n<script async src=\"//www.instagram.com/embed.js\"></script></aside>\n</div><p>Kartal, on the other hand, was locked in from start to finish in her third-round win over Jasmine Paolini, a clinical 6-2, 6-0 beating that took just 67 minutes. She had 14 winners to just eight unforced errors, and won the last 11 games. Playing just her third tournament following a sixth-month injury layoff, she's yet to drop a set in three matches, including another upset of ninth-seeded Belinda Bencic.</p>\n<p>Svitolina and Kartal played at the very start of the year, in Auckland. It was a tight back-and-forth battle, with Svitolina narrowly winning 6-4, 6-7 (2), 7-6 (5).</p>\n<h4>[11] Diana Shnaider vs. Jelena Ostapenko</h4>\n<h5>First career meeting</h5>\n<p>Coming into this tournament, Shnaider didn't have the fondest memories of Wuhan. She had played here twice, and lost in the first round each time. And after arriving from Beijing after reaching the doubles semifinals, she didn't have the highest hopes that this would be the year she'd turn it around.</p>\n<p>\"When I came here, I was dead mentally, and definitely wasn't expecting to do great,\" she said.</p>\n<p>To her surprise, she has been great -- nearly flawless, in fact. Shnaider has won all three of her matches this week in straight sets, the last of which was a 7-5, 6-3 upset of sixth-seeded Karolina Muchova. </p><div class=\"articleWidget center\">\n        <aside class=\"instagram-post embeddable-widget embeddable-widget--floating embeddable-widget--centered-mobile \"><blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" data-instgrm-captioned data-instgrm-permalink=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DegKpKOxDSi/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" data-instgrm-version=\"14\" style=\" background:#FFF; border:0; border-radius:3px; box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width:540px; min-width:326px; padding:0; width:99.375%; width:-webkit-calc(100% - 2px); width:calc(100% - 2px);\"><div style=\"padding:16px;\"> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DegKpKOxDSi/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" style=\" background:#FFFFFF; line-height:0; padding:0 0; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; width:100%;\" target=\"_blank\"> <div style=\" display: flex;